# A repository name with control characters is escaped in the usage error.
args: ls $'example.com/acme/widgeta\eb\u{202e}c\u{200b}d\ne\rf\0g\u{2028}h\x7fi'
exit: 2
--- stderr
sego: error: invalid repository name 'example.com/acme/widgeta\u{1b}b\u{202e}c\u{200b}d e\u{d}f\u{0}g\u{2028}h\u{7f}i'
usage: sego ls [--json] [--recursive] REPO[@REV][:PATH]
